		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_RCMA_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
			<Text>黄埔精训：随机获得国军或共军标签并获得其能力。</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_RCMA_INCREASED_MOVEMENT_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
			<Text>黄埔精训：共军</Text>
