		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_RCMA_INCREASED_STRENGTH_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
			<Text>黄埔精训：国军</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ABILITY_RCMA_INCREASED_STRENGTH_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
			<Text>提供+5 [ICON_Strength] 战斗力（国军）</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DISTRICT_FARM_ADD_1_YIELD_FOOD" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
			<Text>相邻农场提供+{1_num} [ICON_Food] 食物。</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DISTRICT_FARM_ADD_1_YIELD_PRODUCTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
			<Text>相邻农场提供+{1_num} [ICON_Production] 生产力。</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DISTRICT_FARM_ADD_1_YIELD_GOLD" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
			<Text>相邻农场提供+{1_num} [ICON_GOLD] 金币。</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DISTRICT_FARM_ADD_1_YIELD_CULTURE" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
			<Text>相邻农场提供+{1_num} [ICON_Culture] 文化值。</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DISTRICT_FARM_ADD_1_YIELD_FAITH" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
			<Text>相邻农场提供+{1_num} [ICON_Faith] 信仰值。</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DISTRICT_FARM_ADD_1_YIELD_SCIENCE" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
